# MESHBBS target selection and pairing are runtime settings stored in NVS.
# Use the authenticated owner app; serial diagnostics are read-only.
# No Wi-Fi credentials or Bluetooth PIN are stored in build configuration.

menu "MESHBBS board"
config MESHBBS_RGB_GPIO
    int "Addressable RGB LED GPIO"
    range 0 48
    default 48
    help
        Hosyond/YD ESP32-S3 N16R8 uses GPIO48. Some DevKitC-1 revisions
        use GPIO38. Check the board schematic before changing this.
endmenu
